    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114673" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρησμοσύνη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>need, want, poverty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Tyrt.
				10.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.473
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				1.8.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in mystical
			sense, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρος</span> and corresponding
			to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακόσμησις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				65
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.242
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.389c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>importunity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς χ. μετίεσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>service,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.837
			</span></i>.</div>
